[{"title":"秋后二首 其一","author":"徐文卿","text":"种豆山园中，土瘠豆不实。\n捃收能几何，倚杖三叹息。\n况此山下田，旱久苗叶赤。\n无豆尚犹可，无禾孰供食。\n已孤丰稔望，徒费耘耕力。\n官吏更索租，真尔从何出。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53089,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游洞岩","author":"徐文卿","text":"跨马绝风烟，夜与云俱宿。\n弹琴向窗间，微月挂森木。\n晓行岩上路，一溪缘净绿。\n路穷入其中，溪流贯山腹。\n岩开类天设，石乱疑鬼伏。\n水从何自来，乃尔瑩心目。\n岩前野僧居，种桃满空谷。\n惜已过芳时，不见花芬馥。\n平生青霞志，耻受红尘辱。\n老我茅三间，兹山疑可卜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53090,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感兴","author":"徐文卿","text":"百谷所成就，乃在摇落时。\n天欲金玉汝，乃有寒与饥。\n寒饥天所赐，勿遽令心悲。\n草玄寂寞滨，可与古人归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53091,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酒","author":"徐玑","text":"才倾一盏碧澄澄，自是山妻手法成。\n不遣水多防味薄，要令曲少得香清。\n凉从荷叶风边起，煖向梅花月里生。\n世味总无如此味，深知此味即渊明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53092,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"含笑花","author":"徐玑","text":"瓜香浓欲烂，莲莟碧初匀。\n含笑知何处，低头似愧人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53093,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"智果庵","author":"徐玑","text":"居廛终是俗，饭罢即禅房。\n竹荫一庭绿，荷分两岸香。\n拙鸠呼雨缓，老衲补衣忙。\n不厌频来此，岩深风自凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53094,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山茶花","author":"徐玑","text":"山茶又晚出，旧不闻图经。\n花深嫌少态，曾入苏公评。\n迩来亦变怪，纷然著名称。\n黄香开最早，与菊为辈朋。\n纷红更妖艳，玉环带春酲。\n伟哉红百叶，花重枝不胜。\n犹爱并山茶，开花一尺盈。\n日丹又其亚，不减红带鞓。\n吐丝心抽须，锯齿叶剪棱。\n白茶亦数品，玉磬尤精明。\n桃叶何从来，派别疑武陵。\n愈出愈奇怪，一见一欲惊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53095,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"徐玑","text":"照眼妆新就，扶头酒半醒。\n妖姿随变化，薄命易飘零。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53096,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题刘原父书南华秋水篇","author":"徐木润","text":"不识刘公字，今方睹一斑。\n笔兼欧蔡体，品在上中间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53097,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题忠悯公墓志后","author":"徐木润","text":"初心直欲复关河，保蜀功劳不自多。\n诸葛大名垂宇宙，北山千古共巍峨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53098,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题忠悯公送婿邢得昭归婺女诗后 其二","author":"徐木润","text":"小人护局可畏，君子得与常迟。\n老秦殁已一岁，胡李方始量移。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53099,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题忠悯公送婿邢得昭归婺女诗后 其三","author":"徐木润","text":"准用于丁殒后，瓘亡在京死前。\n惜是苍生无福，北山不待隆乾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53100,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题忠悯公送婿邢得昭归婺女诗后 其一","author":"徐木润","text":"中军叹韩甥去，潮州喜湘侄来。\n欲识邢郎高谊，但看郑老饯诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53101,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"徐氏","text":"絮如柳陌三春雨，花落梨园一笛风。\n百尺玉楼帘半捲，夜深人在水晶宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53102,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"流杯池","author":"徐兰皋","text":"楚王宫阙马王宫，惟有江山带旧风。\n属玉不知兴废事，双双飞入藕花丛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53103,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满庭芳","author":"徐去非","text":"凤历书元，龟图画泰，瑞蓂两两初开。\n舞风仙子，飞雪拥春来。\n平荡人间险秽，端为你没点尘埃。\n清明世，冰辉太洁，鸥鹭莫惊猜。\n儿孙，同劝寿，桃添西阆，兰绕南陔。\n看琼玉妆成，万瓦楼台。\n飘洒风流酥满盏，浑疑醉，月影蓬莱。\n从今去，诗高未老，点化尽多才。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53104,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"锦被堆","author":"徐去非","text":"一种两容仪，红共白、交映南枝。\n紫霞仙指冰翁语，花如醉玉，香同臭雪，别样风姿。\n相守岁寒期。\n春造化、密与天知。\n羞将脂粉隈桃李，独先结实，还同戴胜，归宴瑶池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53105,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘲教授","author":"徐用亨","text":"谁把先生号冷官，令名深愧馥秋兰。\n孟公岂是陈惊座，子夏元非杜小冠。\n泾渭合流虽若混，云泥夐绝不相干。\n寄言世上多风鉴，一笑何妨改眼看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53106,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"徐申","text":"深春苦竹寺，细雨海棠花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53107,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"徐申","text":"山川形势连三楚，风月清明占两湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53108,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白蘋洲","author":"徐仲谋","text":"风流人物两相逢，白傅高文纪汉公。\n三圃五亭装郡景，千花万卉媚春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53109,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留题郫县西禅院古调诗","author":"徐仲谋","text":"郫县七十寺，棋布于郊坰。\n景德当道衢，宝塔腾青冥。\n其间西禅院，地胜景物灵。\n何以使索然，中有大藏经。\n自从没官来，卷帙何零丁。\n府民纳其直，将迁离梵庭。\n奇哉陈氏子，睹此而涕零。\n谓寺无九部，何以重佛僧。\n如人去五脏，何以主神形。\n舍财百万馀，赎之俾安宁。\n兰若皆修饰，贝叶重芬馨。\n签函列金玉，堂殿挥丹青。\n永以镇福地，实可壮禅扃。\n命僧开宝藏，煌煌如日星。\n读诵香院里，音响何泠泠。\n闻者与见者，如醉而得醒。\n岂不获洪福，深远于沧溟。\n凡人富金帛，安能延百龄。\n唯有好善道，声誉喧雷霆。\n高吟二百言，长使郫民听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53110,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"徐仲谋","text":"郡城重叠安寝有时延皓月，","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53111,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"徐仲谋","text":"湖上风涛或泛浮，城南因立镇湖楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53112,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"徐仲谋","text":"罗列全如斗极星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53113,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"徐仲谋","text":"郡城重叠耸危楼，最爱清风景物优。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53114,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"徐仲谋","text":"四水交流霅霅声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53115,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠李安抚","author":"徐伉","text":"尚书八座贵，大使十州雄。\n欲得疮痍痤，先怜杼轴空。\n仁民兼爱物，时雨及春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53116,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日","author":"徐似道","text":"衰容不似秋容好，坐上谁怜老孟嘉。\n牢裹乌纱莫吹却，免教白发见黄花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53117,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为刘改之作五首 其五","author":"徐似道","text":"闭门长安十日雨，车马不来蛙黾多。\n若往澹然应子是，作商声者必君歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53118,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为刘改之作五首 其四","author":"徐似道","text":"风吹客袂游甘露，雪打人头入半山。\n无故被他林鸟觉，竞传新句落人间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53119,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为刘改之作五首 其三","author":"徐似道","text":"一生能著几两屐，万户何如千首诗。\n竹隐在傍须径造，醉乡有路莫他之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53120,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为刘改之作五首 其二","author":"徐似道","text":"谪仙昔者号无敌，侯喜中间还有声。\n后五百年无继者，得渠一句便堪听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53121,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为刘改之作五首 其一","author":"徐似道","text":"江西诗社久沦落，晚得一人刘改之。\n不向岭头拈取去，此衣此钵付他谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53122,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水仙花二首 其二","author":"徐似道","text":"林下清风自一家，稍亲梅竹近兰芽。\n祇缘羞与凡花伍，移植名园不肯花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53123,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水仙花二首 其一","author":"徐似道","text":"天然初不事铅华，此是无尘有韵花。\n翠带讵容萦俗客，金杯祗合劝诗家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53124,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"买砚","author":"徐似道","text":"俸馀宜办买山钱，却买端州一砚砖。\n依旧被渠驱使出，买山之事定何年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53125,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹","author":"徐似道","text":"卢仝茅屋面桃李，杜老草堂依柳梅。\n我欲四时相照映，小窗时对此君开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53126,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自笑","author":"徐似道","text":"黄昏茅店带星入，清晓竹舆蒙露行。\n客路三千年五十，对人犹说是归耕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53127,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟中","author":"徐似道","text":"红漆楼船黑占牌，渔翁一见便惊猜。\n生怕打官水交道，撑入芦花唤不来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53128,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈周子充","author":"徐似道","text":"翰林帐下饮羊羔，客子骑驴渡灞桥。\n莫似灵鳌笑浮蚁，戴山负粟各逍遥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53129,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"妙严禅寺","author":"徐似道","text":"宿雾酿成三日雨，晓风鏖退一天云。\n落花院宇浑无事，闲拂碑尘看断文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53130,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"徐似道","text":"一瓶储粟一囊钱，儿学箕裘女纺砖。\n更买小丘吾事毕，勘书评画了残年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53131,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日","author":"徐似道","text":"老觉此身无一堪，尚牵诗课撚衰髯。\n亦知庭院西风恶，直为秋香不下帘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53132,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莼菜二首 其一","author":"徐似道","text":"千里莼丝未下盐，北游谁复话江南。\n可怜一箸秋风味，错被旁人苦未参。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53133,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶题","author":"徐似道","text":"老去功名不挂怀，高眠之外只清斋。\n偶因种竹便多事，风叶扫馀还满阶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53134,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿云岩二首 其二","author":"徐似道","text":"残僧入定夜堂寂，独客不眠山月高。\n静坐了无尘俗态，一灯窗下读离骚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53135,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿云岩二首 其一","author":"徐似道","text":"古书万卷积成蠹，老屋数閒深却幽。\n午枕忽惊毛骨冷，觉来风雨一山秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53136,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"萱草花","author":"徐似道","text":"莫讶萱枝小，能施宫样妆。\n只缘沾染足，绝似杜兰香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53137,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"溪上值雨","author":"徐似道","text":"行到溪光竹色间，客怀于此最相关。\n无端一阵西风雨，不许从容坐看山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53138,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酴醾","author":"徐似道","text":"纷纷红紫落莓苔，带月和烟特地开。\n疑是玉妃新浴出，翠云梯上舞风台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53139,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题苍岭","author":"徐似道","text":"看山每恨眼不饱，上马岂知程可贪。\n还我一筇双不借，缓从云北过云南。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53140,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登白雪楼","author":"徐似道","text":"水落方成放牧坡，水生还作浴鸥波。\n春风自共桃花笑，秀色偏于麦垄多。\n村号莫愁劳想象，石名宋玉谩摩挲。\n试将有裤无襦曲，翻作阳春白雪歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53141,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白龙洞","author":"徐似道","text":"灵仙窟宅不多见，车马往来成再游。\n后洞白云前洞出，上池红叶下池流。\n水花照眼明金鲫，石发藏春护玉虬。\n邂逅尚青游子眼，栖迟应白老僧头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53142,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"守太和","author":"徐似道","text":"我本田家子，驱来作长官。\n政虽无小异，民却自相安。\n静或焚香坐，閒因展画看。\n庸人扰之耳，只道太和难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53143,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和诚斋跋梅坡诗卷","author":"徐似道","text":"知君得法自南昌，作舍何须问道旁。\n二老未尝轻许可，两诗固已为平章。\n胸横云岫无穷意，语带梅坡不尽香。\n政乏绮纨相妩媚，不妨风气似诸王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53144,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岩桂花","author":"徐似道","text":"重重帘幕护金猊，小树花开逼麝脐。\n寒色十分新?粟，春心一点暗通犀。\n香延棋畔仙人斧，影射灯前太乙藜。\n从此再周花甲子，伴公长醉日东西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53145,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"唐史君与正新建浮桥","author":"徐似道","text":"秋风百柁倚江皋，幻出城南不柱桥。\n虹影勒回天际水，鹢头惊退海东潮。\n白银阙里看车马，赤玉阑边听鼓箫。\n硎刃有馀舟楫在，待随芝检上云霄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53146,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海棠","author":"徐似道","text":"子美无诗到海棠，酒边游戏略平章。\n日烘不睡却成睡，风暖无香却自香。\n花事一番劳应接，春光强半被分张。\n速来窠上寻徐老，同醉花前作楚狅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53147,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莼菜二首 其二","author":"徐似道","text":"堆盘缕缕又秋风，客俎齑盐一洗空。\n羹鲙疑居柁楼底，杯螯如堕酒船中。\n莼羹本是诗人事，樽俎那容俗子同。\n不日挽君来快问，请分一箸供涪翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53148,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"缙云道中","author":"徐似道","text":"夜泊红楼市，朝餐黑笠家。\n浅溪才泛鸭，疏树不藏鸦。\n鬲上村坊酒，眉尖野店茶。\n尚缘门有竹，忘却去程赊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53149,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虞仲房司马游园约予不赴因次其韵","author":"徐似道","text":"秘书行处有歌钟，身在名园锦绣丛。\n试问高吟梁苑雪，何如共快楚台风。\n人鸥不去机方息，鱼我相忘乐未穷。\n待得芙容濯云锦，弄花翻水与君同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53150,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题仙居相湖","author":"徐似道","text":"岭名石母谁家母，湖号相公何代公。\n欲问岭云并岭月，怕推湖水与湖风。\n渔翁樵子难重问，墨客骚人苦欲穷。\n愚智校行三十里，朔风吹酒又成空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53151,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题仙居道中","author":"徐似道","text":"地褊山成簇，溪平水不奔。\n晴天带阴色，冬日作春温。\n草聚鸡豚市，机声桑柘村。\n舟人识行李，相约候归辕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53152,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马桥秋月","author":"徐似道","text":"石梁横卧清溪曲，波光上下风吹绿。\n海东推上月轮来，鳞龙闪闪浮寒玉。\n昔人呼为饮马泉，至今饮者谁投钱。\n吟馀不觉露华重，桂花香堕绡衣寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53153,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"北闸停舟","author":"徐似道","text":"昔人筑斯防旱涝，龙钟常相天地造。\n舟航群泊沙外汀，酒旗斜插江亭小。\n岁岁常丰民自怡，几家灯火儿诵诗。\n何处渔歌芦中起，欸乃一声山月低。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53154,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石夫人","author":"徐似道","text":"消山偃蹇消湖碧，夫人此恨消未得。\n海上人归会有时，怪尔鬓云非旧色。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53155,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟行","author":"徐似道","text":"大官连樯十万艘，小官仅得一叶如渔舠。\n其中何所有，白发翁媪并儿曹。\n赤脚婢三后执爨，苍头奴二前操篙。\n玄真笔床间茶灶，吏部酒杯兼蟹螯。\n书缄一箱半鱼蠹，一束百轴成牛腰。\n平铺藁秸荐猫犬，剩买枣栗供猿猱。\n新花郁屈作萎木，清酒荡摇成浊醪。\n篷低日觉牛角折，灶近时闻羹釜轑。\n高骧正难望鹢首，缓进岂敢争龙标。\n全家窘拘叹蹐局，长物屏当随周遭。\n桑枢驷马各是累，人肝薇蕨俱成饕。\n不须彼此更相笑，未必郁林之石贤胡椒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53156,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨梅","author":"徐似道","text":"火齐无光荔实圆，未尝先说齿流涎。\n唤回天竺三年梦，参透披云一味禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53157,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"徐似道","text":"植杞必植梓，艺兰仍艺荪。\n过庭遗训在，凿楹故书存。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53158,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荠","author":"徐似道","text":"萋萋墙根荠，采掇盈一襜。\n破白半浮糁，杀青微下盐。\n长贫叹亦苦，积悟觉尤甘。\n缅想拔葵者，吾今已伤廉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53159,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瓶中梅花","author":"徐似道","text":"可怜玉雪不供愁，似倩诗翁作□□。\n□□此君虽强项，岁寒相对却风流。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":53160,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]